==Battleground==
*10 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*4 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 96.67 seconds<sup>2,900f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 96.67 seconds<sup>2,900f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Though Zombie Killers are not needed, bringing fodder units with Zombie Killer helps a lot. Holy Blast should be a given. Don't worry too much about Zollow here, it'll die as you deal with the other enemies here.

